<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>MournHub - Memorials for the place of rest</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="MournHub helps funeral and cemetery teams give each family an online memorial, opened by one QR code at the place of rest.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f3ec">
  <meta property="og:title" content="MournHub - Memorials for the place of rest">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Online memorials from funeral and cemetery teams, opened by one QR code at the place of rest.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/stone.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/motion.css">
  <script src="/js/motion.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/landing.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="candleGlowOverlay" class="candle-glow-overlay"></div>

  <% const contactHref = contactEmail ? "mailto:" + contactEmail + "?subject=" + encodeURIComponent("MournHub for our organization") : null; %>

  <div class="sheet">
    <header class="masthead">
      <a href="/" class="wordmark">MournHub</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="nav-section">How it works</a>
        <a href="#sample" class="nav-section">Sample memorial</a>
        <a href="#families">For families</a>
        <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="opening">
        <div class="opening-words">
          <h1>A memorial for the place they rest</h1>
          <p class="lede">MournHub helps funeral and cemetery teams give each family an online memorial, opened by one QR code at the place of rest. Visitors don't need an app or an account.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <% if (contactHref) { %>
              <a href="<%= contactHref %>" class="gilded">Talk to us</a>
              <a href="/register">Request an account</a>
            <% } else { %>
              <a href="/register" class="gilded">Request an account</a>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="marker-scene">
          <div class="marker">
            <div class="marker-stone">
              <p class="marker-intro">In loving memory of</p>
              <p class="marker-name">Maria Santos</p>
              <p class="marker-dates">1950 &ndash; 2020</p>
              <% if (sampleQr) { %>
                <div class="marker-plate" role="img" aria-label="QR code that opens the sample memorial on this page"><%- sampleQr %></div>
              <% } %>
            </div>
            <div class="marker-base"></div>
            <svg class="marker-candle" viewBox="0 0 24 44" width="30" height="55" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="7" y="18" width="10" height="24" rx="1.5" fill="#fbfaf6" stroke="#7c8b7f"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="13" stroke="#2e3b34" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <path class="marker-flame" d="M12 14 Q6.5 8 12 0 Q17.5 8 12 14 Z" fill="#d4af58"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption>A sample marker. Scan the plate to open Maria's memorial, or <a href="#sample">see it on this page</a>.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="programme" id="how-it-works">
        <h2>From first draft to the marker</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <h3>Write</h3>
            <p>Add the name, dates, life story and photos with the family. The memorial stays private while you work.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Publish</h3>
            <p>You publish it when the family is ready. Nothing goes live on its own, and you can unpublish it at any time.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Place</h3>
            <p>Download a high-resolution QR code for your plaque or marker. Editing the memorial later doesn't change its link, so a placed code keeps working.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="sample" id="sample">
        <h2>What a visitor sees</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">One scan opens the page on their phone, with nothing to install and nothing to sign up for.</p>

        <article class="memorial-sample" aria-label="Sample memorial">
          <p class="sample-label">Sample memorial. Maria Santos isn't a real person, so it has no real photos.</p>
          <div class="sample-photo" aria-hidden="true">MS</div>
          <p class="sample-intro">In loving memory of</p>
          <h3>Maria Santos</h3>
          <p class="sample-dates">March 14, 1950 &ndash; January 2, 2020</p>
          <button type="button" class="sample-candle" id="sampleCandle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 30" width="30" height="38" aria-hidden="true" class="sample-candle-icon">
              <rect x="8" y="16" width="8" height="12" rx="1" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#5c6b60" stroke-width="1"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="10" stroke="#2e3b34" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <g class="flame-group">
                <path class="flame-outer" d="M12 10 Q7 4 12 -3 Q17 4 12 10 Z" fill="#c98a2b"/>
                <path class="flame-inner" d="M12 8.5 Q9.5 4.5 12 0 Q14.5 4.5 12 8.5 Z" fill="#f0c060"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
            <span id="sampleCandleLabel">Light a candle</span>
          </button>
          <p class="sample-count" aria-live="polite"><span id="sampleCandleCount">12</span> candles lit in remembrance</p>
          <p class="sample-story">Maria taught at the village school for thirty-one years and could still name every child she taught. She kept bees, grew more tomatoes than anyone could eat, and left a bag on every doorstep in August.</p>
          <blockquote>
            <p>She taught me to read, and years later she taught my son.</p>
            <footer>Tomas, June 3, 2024</footer>
          </blockquote>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="programme care">
        <h2>You stay in charge</h2>
        <dl>
          <div>
            <dt>Approved accounts only</dt>
            <dd>Each staff account is approved before it can create a memorial, and access can be revoked at any time.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Private until published</dt>
            <dd>Each memorial belongs to the account that created it, and nobody else can see its draft.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Messages you can remove</dt>
            <dd>Visitors can leave a memory, and you can remove any message.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Out of search results</dt>
            <dd>Published memorials ask search engines not to list them, so people reach them by code or by link.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Photos you can remove</dt>
            <dd>Deleting a photo or a memorial takes it down at once and requests removal of its images from storage.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="families" id="families">
        <h2>If you're here for a family member</h2>
        <p>There's nothing you need to set up. Your funeral home or cemetery can create a memorial with you, so you can ask them whether they use MournHub.</p>
        <% if (contactHref) { %>
          <p>If you have a question about a memorial, you're welcome to <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>">write to us</a>.</p>
        <% } %>
      </section>

      <section class="close">
        <h2>Tell us about the families you serve</h2>
        <p>We'll talk through how MournHub could work for your funeral home or cemetery.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <% if (contactHref) { %>
            <a href="<%= contactHref %>" class="gilded">Talk to us</a>
            <a href="/register">Request an account</a>
          <% } else { %>
            <a href="/register" class="gilded">Request an account</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <% if (contactHref) { %>
          <p class="close-address">Or write to us at <a href="<%= contactHref %>"><%= contactEmail %></a></p>
        <% } %>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="colophon">
      <span>MournHub</span>
      <a href="/login">Staff log in</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
